msgctxt "224"
msgid "You've been causing quite a ruckus in Kamurocho, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid "Who's asking?"
msgstr "Chi lo vuole sapere?"

msgctxt "248"
msgid ""
"You always leave everything around you a mess. Broken beer\r\n"
"bottles everywhere, destroyed signboards, banged-up\r\n"
"trashcans..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid ""
"With aftermath like that, you must be a guy who uses\r\n"
"everything he can get his hands on as a weapon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid ""
"I mean, who does stuff like that, right? Not just any\r\n"
"casual street fighter, that's for sure!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "Huh? Who the hell are you, anyway?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid ""
"Don't you remember? The name's Daiji Hiyama. We fought\r\n"
"in the Underground Coliseum, remember?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid ""
"Hiyama... Oh, yeah. That pro wrestler, right? What do you\r\n"
"want? You still pissed about me beating you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid ""
"Hmph. No! I just wanted to ask you to team up with me\r\n"
"for a tag match."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid "A tag match?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid ""
"That's right, the Tag Match Grand Prix at the Underground\r\n"
"Coliseum."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid "Why me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid "You remind me of my old partner."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid "Is that right?"
msgstr "È così?"

msgctxt "392"
msgid ""
"Yeah. A long time ago I was teamed up with a pro wrestler\r\n"
"named Tatsuhiko Maebara."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid ""
"We called ourselves the Monster Brothers. Not a bad name\r\n"
"for a tag team, eh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid "So why don't you just team up with him again?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid "I can't, not anymore."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid "Why's that?"
msgstr "Perché?"

msgctxt "452"
msgid ""
"Because he's dead. Died exactly one year ago. Cancer's\r\n"
"a bitch."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "464"
msgid "Damn... You got that right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "476"
msgid ""
"I've stayed away from the ring since his death. I even\r\n"
"thought about retiring... But then I asked myself, what\r\n"
"would he think about that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "488"
msgid "He wouldn't be happy to see me acting like this..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "500"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid ""
"That's why I decided to head back into the ring once more\r\n"
"and  put up a good fight, so that wherever he is, he'll\r\n"
"look down at me and be happy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid ""
"That's when I heard about you. Somebody told me that a guy\r\n"
"exactly like my old partner was fighting in the Underground\r\n"
"Coliseum."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "536"
msgid "What?"
msgstr "Cosa?"

msgctxt "548"
msgid ""
"I got so excited, I didn't know what to do with myself!\r\n"
"That's when I decided to go there and fight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "560"
msgid ""
"And guess what? I found the guy they were talking about,\r\n"
"right there at the tournament."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "572"
msgid "And you're saying that guy was me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "584"
msgid ""
"That's right. Your technique, and those eyes of yours...\r\n"
"And more than anything, the way you use anything around\r\n"
"you as a weapon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "596"
msgid ""
"I know it's a selfish thing to ask, but please! Be my tag\r\n"
"partner!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "608"
msgid ""
"I want to show my old partner that I haven't given up on\r\n"
"the ring yet. Please!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "620"
msgid "(Hmm. This guy might make a good tag match partner...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "632"
msgid "Yeah, sure."
msgstr "Sì, certo."

msgctxt "644"
msgid "Really!?"
msgstr "Davvero!?"

msgctxt "656"
msgid ""
"Really. I can't promise I'll be as good as your old partner,\r\n"
"though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "668"
msgid ""
"Don't worry. You're exactly who I've been looking for.\r\n"
"No mistake about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "680"
msgid "Heh."
msgstr "Eh."

msgctxt "692"
msgid ""
"I'll head on to the Underground Coliseum, then. I'll be\r\n"
"waiting for you there! Come on by whenever it's\r\n"
"convenient for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "704"
msgid "Sounds like a plan."
msgstr "Mi sembra un buon piano."

msgctxt "716"
msgid "See you soon!"
msgstr "A presto."

msgctxt "788"
msgid "No."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "800"
msgid "Why not?"
msgstr "Perché no?"

msgctxt "812"
msgid ""
"I feel bad for what happened to you, but I've gotta choose\r\n"
"my partner on my own. Are you really a good fighter\r\n"
"in the ring?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "824"
msgid ""
"Don't you worry about that! I may have lost to you before,\r\n"
"but I can hold my own against those other coliseum fighters!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "836"
msgid ""
"I promise I won't hold you back. I just want to do this\r\n"
"for my old friend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "848"
msgid "All right, then. If it means that much to you, I'll do it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "860"
msgid "Really!?"
msgstr "Davvero!?"

msgctxt "872"
msgid ""
"Really. I can't promise I'll be as good as your old partner,\r\n"
"though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "884"
msgid ""
"Don't worry. You're exactly who I've been looking for.\r\n"
"No mistake about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "896"
msgid "Heh."
msgstr "Eh."

msgctxt "908"
msgid ""
"I'll head on to the Underground Coliseum, then. I'll be\r\n"
"waiting for you there! Come on by whenever it's\r\n"
"convenient for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "920"
msgid "Sounds like a plan."
msgstr "Mi sembra un buon piano."

msgctxt "932"
msgid "See you soon!"
msgstr "A presto."

msgctxt "1004"
msgid ""
"*sigh* Where did all those versatile fighters go?\r\n"
"They weren't afraid to use anything and everything as\r\n"
"a weapon..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1016"
msgid ""
"I don't think I'll ever find anyone like him again. Hell,\r\n"
"he'd break a beer bottle over your head, then beat you\r\n"
"with a signboard..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1028"
msgid ""
"Then he'd finish you off with a trash can! I don't see\r\n"
"anyone who fights like that anymore..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1040"
msgid "What are you talking about?"
msgstr "Di cosa stai parlando?"

msgctxt "1052"
msgid "Huh? Just leave me alone. I'm too busy to talk right now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1064"
msgid "Sure."
msgstr "Certo."

msgctxt "1076"
msgid "No."
msgstr ""

